<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"></font>

3
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kaki narase sonzai wo</b></font></font></font>

4
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>rock away your existence</b></font></font></font>

5
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>koko ni iru to</b></font></font></font>

6
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>shouting that you are here</b></font></font></font>

7
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:11,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>arata na tabi ga ima hajimaru</b></font></font></font>

8
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:11,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>a new journey begins now</b></font></font></font>

9
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:28,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kawari yuku kisetsu no naka wo ikinuku tabi ni bokura</b></font></font></font>

10
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:28,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>as we survived through the changing seasons</b></font></font></font>

11
00:00:28,170 --> 00:00:33,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>chie to tsuyosa wo te ni ireta kedo JUST LOOKS LIKE SURVIVAL GAME</b></font></font></font>

12
00:00:28,170 --> 00:00:33,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>we gained knowledge and strength (just looks like a survival game)</b></font></font></font>

13
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>nagareteku jikan no naka ni</b></font></font></font>

14
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>but the forgotten memories</b></font></font></font>

15
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>okizari ni shita omoi wo</b></font></font></font>

16
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>of the feelings abandoned within the flows of time</b></font></font></font>

17
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:44,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>wasureta koto sura wasurete ita</b></font></font></font>

18
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:44,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>have also been lost</b></font></font></font>

19
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:51,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kuzure kaketa toki kodoku wo shitte</b></font></font></font>

20
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:51,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>when sinking down we learned loneliness</b></font></font></font>

21
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>deaeta bokura hitori ja nai</b></font></font></font>

22
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>but now we've met each other we are no longer alone</b></font></font></font>

23
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>sarake dase kanjou wo banjou no omoi wo</b></font></font></font>

24
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>unveil your feelings those high emotions</b></font></font></font>

25
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>namidame ga unmei wo kaete yuku</b></font></font></font>

26
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>those tears will change your fate</b></font></font></font>

27
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>yami ni uchi narase kodou wo</b></font></font></font>

28
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>pound your heartbeat against the darkness</b></font></font></font>

29
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kitto aeru yo onaji itami no hata no moto de</b></font></font></font>

30
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>we're sure to meet under the same flag of pain</b></font></font></font>

31
00:01:34,820 --> 00:01:36,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't count on you.</font>

32
00:01:38,360 --> 00:01:39,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will go by myself.</font>

33
00:01:41,280 --> 00:01:43,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait. I'll go, too.</font>

34
00:01:46,040 --> 00:01:49,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I promised Hinata that I would
definitely protect you, princess.</font>

35
00:01:52,840 --> 00:01:53,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With Hinata...?</font>

36
00:01:56,130 --> 00:02:00,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She fought with the second Janin
and got hurt badly.</font>

37
00:02:00,300 --> 00:02:01,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata did...?</font>

38
00:02:02,310 --> 00:02:06,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys said that you didn't accept
the mission of protecting me.</font>

39
00:02:07,480 --> 00:02:09,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then why do you concern
yourselves with me?</font>

40
00:02:09,730 --> 00:02:10,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I...</font>

41
00:02:11,520 --> 00:02:14,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not only me,
but Hinata and Choji, too.</font>

42
00:02:14,690 --> 00:02:19,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We don't like it when somebody
before us is hurt or sad. That's all.</font>

43
00:02:22,740 --> 00:02:24,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, let's go!</font>

44
00:02:24,450 --> 00:02:27,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we pass through the valley ahead of us,
we'll get to the town.</font>

45
00:02:27,460 --> 00:02:31,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we do that, they probably won't
chase us all the way there!</font>

46
00:02:37,550 --> 00:02:43,470
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Death Sentence</font>

47
00:02:37,550 --> 00:02:43,470
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Cloudy with a Chance of Sun</font>

48
00:02:45,600 --> 00:02:49,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Too bad, but you guys won't be able
to reach that village.</font>

49
00:02:49,390 --> 00:02:51,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since you guys are going to die here!</font>

50
00:02:51,770 --> 00:02:55,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why is he floating in the air?</font>

51
00:02:57,150 --> 00:03:03,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, kid, I bet a low-class Ninja like you
can't even imagine my Jutsu.</font>

52
00:03:04,700 --> 00:03:05,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take this!</font>

53
00:03:12,380 --> 00:03:13,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

54
00:03:14,420 --> 00:03:15,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm okay.</font>

55
00:03:16,840 --> 00:03:19,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But what just flew at me?</font>

56
00:03:20,510 --> 00:03:22,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't waste your time fighting me.</font>

57
00:03:23,340 --> 00:03:26,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have already captured
all three of your friends.</font>

58
00:03:26,850 --> 00:03:27,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

59
00:03:28,430 --> 00:03:30,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just hand over the girl.</font>

60
00:03:30,850 --> 00:03:33,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you do that, I'll spare your friends.</font>

61
00:03:34,190 --> 00:03:35,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji and Hinata...</font>

62
00:03:38,150 --> 00:03:40,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, what are you going to do, kid?</font>

63
00:03:41,820 --> 00:03:45,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, are you going
to abandon me, too?</font>

64
00:03:45,780 --> 00:03:49,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, no, this princess is telling you
to save her</font>

65
00:03:49,870 --> 00:03:51,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and let your friends die.</font>

66
00:03:52,250 --> 00:03:57,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I don't mind that kind of thinking
since it's the same as mine.</font>

67
00:03:58,500 --> 00:04:00,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Same as yours?</font>

68
00:04:00,590 --> 00:04:01,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right.</font>

69
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:04,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If someone is useful,
then you should make use of them,</font>

70
00:04:04,470 --> 00:04:06,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">even though they may be
your siblings.</font>

71
00:04:06,100 --> 00:04:08,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is one thing I need
to thank you guys for.</font>

72
00:04:09,270 --> 00:04:11,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank us? For what?!</font>

73
00:04:11,810 --> 00:04:14,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For doing in Ruiga and Jiga.</font>

74
00:04:14,560 --> 00:04:18,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was going to put an end to them myself
sooner or later, anyway.</font>

75
00:04:18,650 --> 00:04:19,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?</font>

76
00:04:20,440 --> 00:04:23,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was clear
that they would soon tell me:</font>

77
00:04:23,280 --> 00:04:26,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"Big Brother, give us the property
and the money, too."</font>

78
00:04:27,990 --> 00:04:30,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Three feudal lords are not necessary
in one country.</font>

79
00:04:31,080 --> 00:04:33,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And you still call yourselves brothers?!</font>

80
00:04:33,870 --> 00:04:35,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It doesn't matter.</font>

81
00:04:35,580 --> 00:04:37,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whether it's my parents
or my brothers,</font>

82
00:04:37,460 --> 00:04:40,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll make use of anything I can.</font>

83
00:04:41,960 --> 00:04:45,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, give her to me.</font>

84
00:04:45,510 --> 00:04:46,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I refuse.</font>

85
00:04:47,140 --> 00:04:48,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see.</font>

86
00:04:48,760 --> 00:04:49,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

87
00:04:50,010 --> 00:04:52,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A person who would abandon
his siblings</font>

88
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:55,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">would never keep his promise with me.</font>

89
00:04:56,600 --> 00:04:57,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, that's true.</font>

90
00:05:02,240 --> 00:05:03,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's impossible, Naruto!</font>

91
00:05:03,780 --> 00:05:05,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't even know
what kind of Jutsu it is!</font>

92
00:05:05,740 --> 00:05:07,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That doesn't matter!</font>

93
00:05:07,700 --> 00:05:09,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

94
00:05:23,920 --> 00:05:24,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take this!</font>

95
00:05:28,800 --> 00:05:30,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is this guy?</font>

96
00:05:30,140 --> 00:05:32,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's something hard around
his body that I can't see.</font>

97
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:38,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

98
00:05:39,400 --> 00:05:44,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry, but none
of your Ninjutsu works on me.</font>

99
00:05:44,360 --> 00:05:45,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not even one.</font>

100
00:05:46,990 --> 00:05:48,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

101
00:05:59,250 --> 00:06:00,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?</font>

102
00:06:04,090 --> 00:06:06,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is that?</font>

103
00:06:06,470 --> 00:06:07,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Crystallized ice...?</font>

104
00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:12,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can gather water vapor in the air</font>

105
00:06:12,350 --> 00:06:15,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and instantly turn it
into crystallized ice.</font>

106
00:06:17,270 --> 00:06:20,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, the things that just attacked me
were ice Shuriken.</font>

107
00:06:20,400 --> 00:06:23,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man! It's hard to see
if it's transparent ice.</font>

108
00:06:24,980 --> 00:06:27,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just that is not too interesting.</font>

109
00:06:31,700 --> 00:06:33,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is this great sense of danger?</font>

110
00:06:33,950 --> 00:06:37,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sure his Jutsu has already started!</font>

111
00:06:37,540 --> 00:06:39,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where is it?
Where is it coming from?!</font>

112
00:06:40,710 --> 00:06:43,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kid, do you know
today's weather forecast?</font>

113
00:06:44,380 --> 00:06:45,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Weather forecast?</font>

114
00:06:45,590 --> 00:06:47,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Cloudy and partly sunny.</font>

115
00:06:47,420 --> 00:06:49,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's good weather for you to die in.</font>

116
00:06:58,810 --> 00:07:00,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is this?</font>

117
00:07:10,110 --> 00:07:11,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

118
00:07:12,450 --> 00:07:13,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look out!</font>

119
00:07:31,590 --> 00:07:33,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Damn it!
— Naruto!</font>

120
00:07:34,550 --> 00:07:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— That's a lens!
— Lens?!</font>

121
00:07:39,270 --> 00:07:41,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yup, I turned
the crystallized ice into lens</font>

122
00:07:41,690 --> 00:07:43,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to gather the sunlight and shoot it.</font>

123
00:07:43,480 --> 00:07:48,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, I can't really control it,
but it'll be an instant when you die.</font>

124
00:07:49,280 --> 00:07:51,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As soon as the battle condition
at the Land of Green is prepared,</font>

125
00:07:52,030 --> 00:07:55,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll burn up the surrounding countries
with this Jutsu.</font>

126
00:08:05,170 --> 00:08:06,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This way!</font>

127
00:08:15,430 --> 00:08:16,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's no use.</font>

128
00:08:16,640 --> 00:08:18,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can even see things
that are a thousand miles away.</font>

129
00:08:42,500 --> 00:08:44,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I found you.</font>

130
00:09:15,610 --> 00:09:18,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto... Why do you protect me?</font>

131
00:09:19,950 --> 00:09:21,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder why.</font>

132
00:09:22,240 --> 00:09:23,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know either.</font>

133
00:09:25,040 --> 00:09:26,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

134
00:09:50,560 --> 00:09:51,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Haruna.</font>

135
00:09:52,650 --> 00:09:56,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">While I distract him, run!</font>

136
00:10:06,460 --> 00:10:09,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't even think you guys can get away
from my Jutsu by doing that!</font>

137
00:10:35,650 --> 00:10:37,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You decided to hand over the princess?</font>

138
00:10:38,150 --> 00:10:40,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who would hand over Haruna
to the likes of you?!</font>

139
00:10:41,530 --> 00:10:42,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a fool.</font>

140
00:10:42,830 --> 00:10:45,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm telling you that if you hand over
the selfish princess</font>

141
00:10:45,200 --> 00:10:49,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and go back to the village,
I'll let your friends go.</font>

142
00:10:49,460 --> 00:10:53,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I promised Hinata
that I would save Haruna!</font>

143
00:10:55,380 --> 00:10:57,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just to keep a promise to your friend,</font>

144
00:10:57,420 --> 00:11:00,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you're gonna risk your life to fight
in a hopeless battle, huh?</font>

145
00:11:04,560 --> 00:11:06,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're just like the feudal lord
in Land of Green.</font>

146
00:11:06,970 --> 00:11:09,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A big, good-natured fool!</font>

147
00:11:10,440 --> 00:11:13,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Same as my father...</font>

148
00:11:18,860 --> 00:11:21,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're just like the feudal lord
in Land of Green.</font>

149
00:11:21,530 --> 00:11:23,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A big, good-natured fool!</font>

150
00:11:24,700 --> 00:11:27,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Same as my father...</font>

151
00:11:27,790 --> 00:11:30,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is what the feudal lord
foolishly said</font>

152
00:11:30,330 --> 00:11:32,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to us who were trying to take over
the Land of Green:</font>

153
00:11:33,880 --> 00:11:37,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"Please do not torment the people
in this country."</font>

154
00:11:38,550 --> 00:11:39,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I beg you!</font>

155
00:11:39,590 --> 00:11:41,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't care what happens to me,</font>

156
00:11:41,550 --> 00:11:43,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but please promise me one thing!</font>

157
00:11:44,090 --> 00:11:47,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is a small, weak country
surrounded by big countries.</font>

158
00:11:47,260 --> 00:11:50,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Without the powers of the people,
the country cannot prosper!</font>

159
00:11:50,730 --> 00:11:52,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In order for the country to prosper,</font>

160
00:11:52,520 --> 00:11:54,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we must take care of individual people</font>

161
00:11:54,860 --> 00:11:57,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and not sacrifice a single life!</font>

162
00:11:57,900 --> 00:11:59,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want you to consider the people a family</font>

163
00:11:59,780 --> 00:12:01,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and not torment them.</font>

164
00:12:03,240 --> 00:12:04,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am the feudal lord!</font>

165
00:12:04,910 --> 00:12:07,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It doesn't matter what I do
to the people, right?</font>

166
00:12:08,490 --> 00:12:09,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why...</font>

167
00:12:12,000 --> 00:12:15,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why this country has been
at peace until now!</font>

168
00:12:16,090 --> 00:12:17,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Peace doesn't matter to me.</font>

169
00:12:17,960 --> 00:12:20,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All I need to do is use the people
as stepping stones</font>

170
00:12:20,090 --> 00:12:21,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and feather my nest!</font>

171
00:12:22,130 --> 00:12:23,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And because of that kind
of good nature,</font>

172
00:12:23,880 --> 00:12:25,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">his daughter was taken as a hostage!</font>

173
00:12:27,050 --> 00:12:28,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean?!</font>

174
00:12:29,680 --> 00:12:32,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems like it was ten years ago.</font>

175
00:12:33,980 --> 00:12:37,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A lot of people were sacrificed
under pressure of the big country.</font>

176
00:12:38,900 --> 00:12:43,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Riots occurred in the country
and the country came close to corruption.</font>

177
00:12:44,490 --> 00:12:46,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was a bitter decision.</font>

178
00:12:47,280 --> 00:12:49,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I had no choice
but to let my daughter,</font>

179
00:12:49,660 --> 00:12:51,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who is more important than my life,
be taken as a hostage.</font>

180
00:12:52,790 --> 00:12:55,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know that Haruna will not forgive me.</font>

181
00:12:58,590 --> 00:13:02,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A cold-hearted father who sacrificed
his own daughter</font>

182
00:13:02,260 --> 00:13:04,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">just for the peace of the country.</font>

183
00:13:07,390 --> 00:13:10,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why don't you ask
your daughter directly?!</font>

184
00:13:11,180 --> 00:13:12,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the afterlife!</font>

185
00:13:14,980 --> 00:13:17,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My father was... killed!</font>

186
00:13:19,570 --> 00:13:21,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What an outrageously
good-natured person, huh?</font>

187
00:13:21,730 --> 00:13:23,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're wrong,
he was a great feudal lord!</font>

188
00:13:25,900 --> 00:13:27,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

189
00:13:28,200 --> 00:13:29,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen!</font>

190
00:13:29,660 --> 00:13:31,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are two kinds of human beings
in this world.</font>

191
00:13:31,740 --> 00:13:34,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those who use others,
and those who get used!</font>

192
00:13:35,750 --> 00:13:38,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In my case,
I will get to the top using anyone,</font>

193
00:13:38,880 --> 00:13:40,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">whether it's my parents or my friends.</font>

194
00:13:40,790 --> 00:13:43,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You...! I'll never forgive you!</font>

195
00:13:43,760 --> 00:13:45,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!</font>

196
00:13:55,100 --> 00:13:57,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn...!</font>

197
00:14:06,860 --> 00:14:08,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Die!</font>

198
00:14:18,250 --> 00:14:19,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto.</font>

199
00:14:20,880 --> 00:14:22,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can't move anymore?!</font>

200
00:14:26,380 --> 00:14:27,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're not the one...</font>

201
00:14:29,720 --> 00:14:34,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was because of Haruna's father
that this country was peaceful.</font>

202
00:14:36,680 --> 00:14:39,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The person who is going
to succeed this country is...</font>

203
00:14:42,610 --> 00:14:44,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The person is...</font>

204
00:14:45,530 --> 00:14:47,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Haruna!</font>

205
00:14:51,160 --> 00:14:52,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop!</font>

206
00:14:53,030 --> 00:14:55,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stupid! Why aren't you running away?!</font>

207
00:14:55,950 --> 00:15:00,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kill me! If you kill me,
your goal will be fulfilled, right?!</font>

208
00:15:01,040 --> 00:15:03,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto... Naruto has nothing
to do with this!</font>

209
00:15:04,250 --> 00:15:07,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, both the father
and daughter are naive, after all.</font>

210
00:15:07,670 --> 00:15:10,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why not complain to your father
in the afterlife</font>

211
00:15:10,090 --> 00:15:12,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for making you sacrifice your life
for the country?</font>

212
00:15:15,390 --> 00:15:17,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How scary.</font>

213
00:15:18,930 --> 00:15:20,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You...!</font>

214
00:15:25,400 --> 00:15:27,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's time for you to die, kid.</font>

215
00:15:27,280 --> 00:15:28,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not a kid!</font>

216
00:15:28,860 --> 00:15:30,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My name is Uzumaki Naruto.</font>

217
00:15:30,990 --> 00:15:33,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not going to hand over
the Land of Green</font>

218
00:15:33,320 --> 00:15:36,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to a person like you!</font>

219
00:15:38,040 --> 00:15:39,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

220
00:15:43,580 --> 00:15:44,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Die!</font>

221
00:15:51,550 --> 00:15:52,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

222
00:16:04,690 --> 00:16:06,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No... way.</font>

223
00:16:11,610 --> 00:16:15,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, kid, it's too late,
even though you took me down.</font>

224
00:16:15,950 --> 00:16:18,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Land of Green
without a feudal lord will collapse,</font>

225
00:16:18,290 --> 00:16:20,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">due to the war between
the larger countries over its territory.</font>

226
00:16:21,040 --> 00:16:23,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Too bad, but that's not gonna happen!</font>

227
00:16:25,790 --> 00:16:27,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shizune!</font>

228
00:16:28,250 --> 00:16:31,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a pain,
but we came to get you guys!</font>

229
00:16:31,550 --> 00:16:32,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru!</font>

230
00:16:32,720 --> 00:16:35,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I didn't ask you guys
to come get us!</font>

231
00:16:36,050 --> 00:16:39,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you look pretty beaten up.</font>

232
00:16:39,350 --> 00:16:41,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, no, this is...</font>

233
00:16:41,640 --> 00:16:42,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

234
00:16:44,100 --> 00:16:46,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji! Hinata! Yurinojou!</font>

235
00:16:46,980 --> 00:16:48,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone was safe!</font>

236
00:16:49,110 --> 00:16:52,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah. We were rescued
by the people of Leaf Village.</font>

237
00:16:52,280 --> 00:16:57,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Oh, yeah, why are you guys here?</font>

238
00:16:57,660 --> 00:17:00,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We received notice of a coup d'etat
in the Land of Green,</font>

239
00:17:00,200 --> 00:17:02,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and Tsunade-sama herself ordered me
to come.</font>

240
00:17:03,410 --> 00:17:07,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Princess Haruna's father was very kind
to Tsunade-sama and me.</font>

241
00:17:08,420 --> 00:17:09,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My father?</font>

242
00:17:09,960 --> 00:17:15,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please forgive us, when we arrived,
your father was already...</font>

243
00:17:15,880 --> 00:17:18,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see. I've caused
so much trouble for you.</font>

244
00:17:19,720 --> 00:17:21,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

245
00:17:21,180 --> 00:17:23,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The position of the feudal lord
that I finally got ahold of...</font>

246
00:17:23,350 --> 00:17:27,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But then the surrounding countries
are not going to stay quiet.</font>

247
00:17:27,730 --> 00:17:28,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's okay.</font>

248
00:17:29,190 --> 00:17:31,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An announcement has been sent out
to the neighbouring countries</font>

249
00:17:31,190 --> 00:17:33,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in the name of the next feudal lord.</font>

250
00:17:33,990 --> 00:17:36,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Under your name, Princess Haruna.</font>

251
00:17:36,240 --> 00:17:39,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then we don't need to worry about
the country getting attacked anymore!</font>

252
00:17:39,280 --> 00:17:40,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Haruna!</font>

253
00:17:44,330 --> 00:17:45,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Haruna.</font>

254
00:17:51,250 --> 00:17:52,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do it.</font>

255
00:17:52,420 --> 00:17:54,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You want to take revenge
into your own hands, right?</font>

256
00:17:54,920 --> 00:17:56,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd do the same if I were you.</font>

257
00:18:11,320 --> 00:18:14,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am... not like you!</font>

258
00:18:29,210 --> 00:18:30,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Haruna...</font>

259
00:18:52,810 --> 00:18:55,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kikunojou, please forgive me.</font>

260
00:18:55,980 --> 00:18:56,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Princess Haruna.</font>

261
00:18:57,400 --> 00:19:00,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here, Kikunojou could look over
the Land of Green.</font>

262
00:19:00,280 --> 00:19:03,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sure that Kikunojou will watch
over everyone forever.</font>

263
00:19:05,910 --> 00:19:08,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, Lady Haruna, we are leaving now.</font>

264
00:19:09,920 --> 00:19:13,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you,
Naruto, Choji and Hinata.</font>

265
00:19:14,340 --> 00:19:17,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shizune, I'd like to ask a special favor.</font>

266
00:19:17,880 --> 00:19:19,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it, Princess Haruna?</font>

267
00:19:20,050 --> 00:19:24,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My role is to take over my father's will
to protect the peace of Land of Green.</font>

268
00:19:25,010 --> 00:19:26,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In order to do that,</font>

269
00:19:26,100 --> 00:19:28,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to borrow some help
from the Leaf Village.</font>

270
00:19:28,560 --> 00:19:30,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Our help?
— Yes.</font>

271
00:19:31,230 --> 00:19:32,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want you to lend me Naruto.</font>

272
00:19:35,610 --> 00:19:37,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please, Naruto.</font>

273
00:19:37,820 --> 00:19:38,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Princess Haruna.</font>

274
00:19:39,950 --> 00:19:44,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want you to help me
with the revival of the Land of Green.</font>

275
00:19:53,460 --> 00:19:54,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I... I...</font>

276
00:19:58,340 --> 00:20:01,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry,
but I can't really do that.</font>

277
00:20:04,050 --> 00:20:07,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I need to go back to my friends.</font>

278
00:20:07,720 --> 00:20:10,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And I need to do more training
and become much stronger.</font>

279
00:20:10,850 --> 00:20:13,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are things that I must do.</font>

280
00:20:13,690 --> 00:20:16,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's all for my precious friends!</font>

281
00:20:18,360 --> 00:20:20,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then I can't take you away from them.</font>

282
00:20:21,360 --> 00:20:26,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, I'll promise that I will do
my best to keep my father's wishes</font>

283
00:20:26,450 --> 00:20:31,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and strive for a peaceful country
where no one will be sacrificed.</font>

284
00:20:33,460 --> 00:20:35,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah! It's a promise!</font>

285
00:20:42,010 --> 00:20:45,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you! Naruto!</font>

286
00:20:45,300 --> 00:20:46,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Goodbye, everybody!</font>

287
00:20:47,220 --> 00:20:48,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll come back someday!</font>

288
00:20:49,060 --> 00:20:51,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Bye!
— See ya!</font>

